.TH "YAMLR-IDP-EXPORT" "1" "May 2026" "Yamlr Manual" "User Commands"
.SH "NAME"
yamlr-idp-export \- Propose repairs and remediate Kubernetes manifests.
.SH "DESCRIPTION"
[PRO] Export safety and compliance metrics to Internal Developer Portals (IDPs).
.PP
.SH "SYNOPSIS"
.nf
.RS
yamlr idp-export --format backstage
yamlr idp-export init --format backstage --output-file catalog-info.yaml
.RE
.fi
.SH "COMMANDS"
.IP "\(bu" 2
\fBinit\fR: Generate opinionated integration templates for your IDP.
.SH "FORMATS"
.IP "\(bu" 2
\fBbackstage\fR: Emits a JSON array suitable for Backstage component annotations. Includes \fByamlr.dev/safety-score\fR and top risks.
.IP "\(bu" 2
\fBprometheus\fR: Emits OpenMetrics text format for ingestion into Prometheus/Grafana.
.IP "\(bu" 2
\fBjson\fR: Raw internal safety specification for custom integrations.
.SH "FLAGS"
.IP "\(bu" 2
\fB--format\fR: Target platform format (\fBbackstage\fR, \fBprometheus\fR, \fBjson\fR).
.IP "\(bu" 2
\fB--output-file\fR: Path to write the generated template or export data.
.SS " Universal Expert Flags"
Available across primary commands:
.PP
.IP "\(bu" 2
  \fB\fB--timing\fR\fR: [PERFORMANCE] Output surgical execution timing breakdown.
.IP "\(bu" 2
  \fB\fB--timing-file <FILE>\fR\fR: [PERFORMANCE] Save performance profiling data to a JSON file.
.IP "\(bu" 2
  \fB\fB--verbose\fR\fR: Full audit logs and engine stages.
.IP "\(bu" 2
  \fB-q\fR, \fB--quiet\fR: Minimal output mode (exit codes only).
.SH "REPORTING BUGS"
Report bugs to <https://github.com/yamlr/yamlr/issues>
.PP
